### Data Structures and Algorithms Used

| Concept | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Hash Map (`unordered_map`) | Stores questions and their frequencies |
| Vector | Stores question-frequency pairs |
| Sorting | Ranks questions by frequency |
| Strings | Stores and compares question text |
| OOP (`RepeatedQuestion`) | Organizes question-related data |

### Algorithm Complexity

Let:
- `N` = Total number of questions.
- `U` = Number of unique questions.

**Frequency Counting:** Average O(N)

**Sorting:** O(U log U)

**Overall Average Time Complexity:** O(N + U log U)

